{"id":"nichego","lemma":"ничего","pos":"pron","rank":59,"glosses":["nothing","it's nothing, it's fine"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8a/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Здесь для нас больше ничего нет.","en":"There's nothing else for us here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1098776","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"us","l":"мы"},{"g":"any more"},null,{"g":"no / there isn't"}]},{"text":"Я ничего не обещаю.","en":"I'm not making any promises.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283355","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to promise, to pledge","l":"обещать"}]},{"text":"Всё или ничего.","en":"It's all or nothing.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"or"},null]},{"text":"Ничего, если я это сделаю?","en":"Is it OK if I do that?","words":[null,{"g":"if, in case"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"}]},{"text":"Ты ничего не забыл?","en":"Did you forget anything?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687076","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"забыть"}]}]}